# Wave W17-V (Route 205): gale sand — valley-road pale sand: a warm bright pale sand running Honeyfield to the forest mouth, wind-polished and clean (design-authorised: a clear connected path of pale sand running end to end). Split from Route 202’s cool civic spire sand by warmth: the valley road is country-kept, the approach city-kept.
